OL,3,GNEWSATwo people die after Legionnaires'
OL,4,Adisease outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died after contracting
OL,7,FLegionnaires' disease in South
OL,8,FYorkshire, health experts said.
OL,10,FAn outbreak in Rotherham in September
OL,11,Fwas confirmed by the UK Health Security
OL,12,FAgency (UKHSA) in early October, with
OL,13,Fthe source of the contamination not yet
OL,14,Fidentified.
OL,16,FThe UKHSA said it was "not currently
OL,17,Fconfirmed if the disease contributed
OL,18,Fto, or caused the deaths". No further
OL,19,Fdetails were shared by the agency about
OL,20,Fthe two people.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
