OL,3,GNEWSATwo people die after Legionnaires'
OL,4,Adisease outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe risk of further outbreaks "remains
OL,7,Flow", the agency said, following a
OL,8,F"small number of cases" in the
OL,9,FKimberworth Park area. No further cases
OL,10,Fhave been identified since early
OL,11,FOctober.
